{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the haunting world of <i>Legend of Krigz</i>, a gripping horror survival experience set in a desolate, abandoned suburban town. You play as a specialist investigating the disappearance of an exploration team that ventured too far into a place they shouldn\u2019t have. A government experiment gone wrong has unleashed a terror unlike any other\u2014a monstrous, electricity-feeding predator known as <strong>Krigz</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay in the light or risk becoming the next victim. With limited resources, an adaptive enemy, and an environment where every flickering light could be a warning, survival is not guaranteed. Choose your approach: gather resources and set traps, or stay in the shadows and outmaneuver Krigz before it finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Watch your stats</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/9770378614c20d923083495dcf9be538.poster.avif?t=1772453284\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/9770378614c20d923083495dcf9be538.webm?t=1772453284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/9770378614c20d923083495dcf9be538.mp4?t=1772453284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Explore</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/a63d27f75b483a2ca471f2d7bafdc17a.poster.avif?t=1772453284\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/a63d27f75b483a2ca471f2d7bafdc17a.webm?t=1772453284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/a63d27f75b483a2ca471f2d7bafdc17a.mp4?t=1772453284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Manage your Inventory</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/96c3f12768e1904c3165a5af9b05001f.poster.avif?t=1772453284\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/96c3f12768e1904c3165a5af9b05001f.webm?t=1772453284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/96c3f12768e1904c3165a5af9b05001f.mp4?t=1772453284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic AI Creature</strong> \u2013 Krigz learns from your actions, adapting to your strategies and forcing you to constantly evolve your tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day/Night Cycle</strong> \u2013 Use the daylight to prepare, but once night falls, Krigz emerges to hunt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management &amp; Exploration</strong> \u2013 Scavenge for supplies, medkits and trap parts to increase your chances of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-Based Threat Detection</strong> \u2013 Krigz feeds off electrical sources, making powered locations dangerous. Turning on lights may help you see, but it will also make you easier to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Your choices shape the outcome. Will you escape, defeat the creature, or uncover a deeper mystery?</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3580050?t=1772453284","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3580050?t=1772453284","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/ae41681a2520f1278015c3f632c1eddac63dfaff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772453284","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/ae41681a2520f1278015c3f632c1eddac63dfaff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772453284","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the haunting world of <i>Legend of Krigz</i>, a gripping horror survival experience set in a desolate, abandoned suburban town. You play as a specialist investigating the disappearance of an exploration team that ventured too far into a place they shouldn\u2019t have. A government experiment gone wrong has unleashed a terror unlike any other\u2014a monstrous, electricity-feeding predator known as <strong>Krigz</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay in the light or risk becoming the next victim. With limited resources, an adaptive enemy, and an environment where every flickering light could be a warning, survival is not guaranteed. Choose your approach: gather resources and set traps, or stay in the shadows and outmaneuver Krigz before it finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Watch your stats</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/9770378614c20d923083495dcf9be538.poster.avif?t=1772453284\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/9770378614c20d923083495dcf9be538.webm?t=1772453284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/9770378614c20d923083495dcf9be538.mp4?t=1772453284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Explore</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/a63d27f75b483a2ca471f2d7bafdc17a.poster.avif?t=1772453284\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/a63d27f75b483a2ca471f2d7bafdc17a.webm?t=1772453284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/a63d27f75b483a2ca471f2d7bafdc17a.mp4?t=1772453284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Manage your Inventory</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580050/extras/96c3f12768e1904c3165a5af9b05001f.poster.avif?t=1772453284\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st